        "name": "Factor Extraction from Focal Split",
        "pseudocode": "Input: Lens L, source set S, target N\nOutput: Factors (d, e) or FAIL\n\n1. Find focal minimizers F = FocalMinimizers(L, S)\n2. If |F| < 2, return FAIL\n3. For each pair (v\u2081, v\u2082) in F \u00d7 F with v\u2081 \u2260 v\u2082:\n   a. For each divisor d of N with 1 < d < N:\n      i. Let e = N/d\n      ii. If factorWitness(v\u2081, d) and factorWitness(v\u2082, e):\n          return (d, e)\n4. Return FAIL\n\nComplexity: O(|F|\u00b2 \u00b7 \u221aN)",
