        "pseudocode": "Input: Finite arch set O, eval, cost, target x\n1. s \u2190 eval(x)\n2. fiber \u2190 {y \u2208 O : eval(y) = s}\n3. Return argmin_{y \u2208 fiber} cost(y)\nComplexity: O(|O| \u00b7 T_eval)\nCorrectness: Thm 3.5 (minimizer_exists)"
