        "name": "Stabilization Depth Computation",
        "pseudocode": "Algorithm: ComputeStabilizationDepth\nInput: contraction ratio c in [0,1), Lipschitz constant L >= 0,\n       diameter D >= 0, tolerance eps > 0\nOutput: Stabilization depth N\n\nIf L * D = 0: return 0\nIf c = 0: return 1\nN = ceil(log(eps / (L * D)) / log(c))\nreturn max(N, 0)\n\nComplexity: O(1)\nCorrectness: For all words w with |w| >= N,\n  dY(o(T_w x), o(T_w y)) <= L * c^N * D <= eps"
